  "overview": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7beac3d65f5593c896838e8eb0985d6c2e798675ecd54e1d080318e0aeb33143",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7beac3d65f55-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners, the case presents two disparate views of the loss required to sustain a securities\u2011fraud claim under the Reform Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Hungar",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7beac3d65f5593c896838e8eb0985d6c2e798675ecd54e1d080318e0aeb33143",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7beac3d65f55-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Hungar, petitioners argue that loss causation requires the plaintiff to demonstrate that the inflation attributable to the misrepresentation has been removed or reduced through corrective information to the market."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Cooughlin and Mr. Couglin",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7beac3d65f5593c896838e8eb0985d6c2e798675ecd54e1d080318e0aeb33143",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7beac3d65f55-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "7beac3d65f5593c896838e8eb0985d6c2e798675ecd54e1d080318e0aeb33143",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7beac3d65f55-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Respondents contend that Section\u202f9(b) of the Reform Act does not apply to materiality, loss causation, or damages, and that recovery is only possible if the inflation is taken out of the stock."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
  },
  "party_positions": [
    {
      "claims": [
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Hungar",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "7beac3d65f5593c896838e8eb0985d6c2e798675ecd54e1d080318e0aeb33143",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-7beac3d65f55-0001-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 19,
                "start": 19
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Hungar, petitioners argue that loss causation requires the plaintiff to show that the inflation attributable to the misrepresentation has been removed or reduced through corrective information to the market."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "William F. Sullivan",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "7beac3d65f5593c896838e8eb0985d6c2e798675ecd54e1d080318e0aeb33143",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-7beac3d65f55-0003-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 54,
                "start": 54
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to William F. Sullivan, damages must be the result of the misrepresentation, not of other factors."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Sullivan",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "7beac3d65f5593c896838e8eb0985d6c2e798675ecd54e1d080318e0aeb33143",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-7beac3d65f55-0003-0004"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 55,
                "start": 55
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Sullivan, the loss\u2011causation codification in the Reform Act is meaningful and creates a pleading standard that must be satisfied at the time of filing."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Sullivan",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "7beac3d65f5593c896838e8eb0985d6c2e798675ecd54e1d080318e0aeb33143",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-7beac3d65f55-0003-0005"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 56,
                "start": 56
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Sullivan, the Reform Act\u2019s loss\u2011causation requirement provides defendants a meaningful opportunity to respond, serving as a screen for frivolous securities\u2011fraud claims."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Petitioners",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
      "summary_citations": []
    },
    {
      "claims": [
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Cooughlin",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "7beac3d65f5593c896838e8eb0985d6c2e798675ecd54e1d080318e0aeb33143",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-7beac3d65f55-0001-0004"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 28,
                "start": 28
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Cooughlin, section\u202f9(b) of the Reform Act applies only to fraud itself and not to materiality, loss causation, or damages."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Couglin",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "7beac3d65f5593c896838e8eb0985d6c2e798675ecd54e1d080318e0aeb33143",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-7beac3d65f55-0002-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 36,
                "start": 36
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Couglin, recovery is possible only if the inflation is taken out of the stock, which constitutes recoverable damages under Ninth Circuit law."
        }
      ],
